      "C": "After year $1$ the value is $\\mathrm{Rs}\\,9000$; after year $2$ it is $\\mathrm{Rs}\\,9000\\times 0.75=\\mathrm{Rs}\\,6750$.",
      "D": "The value is $25\\%$, the printed depreciation rate."
